root_cause=Passive browser restore could consume origin-scoped XummPkceJwt state from the other Xaman application on the same xrbitcoincash.com origin, fail app verification, and leave XRBitcoin in sessionFault / ambiguous Signing blocked state.
repair=Browser restore is explicit only; deliberate XRB Connect clears the origin PKCE cache and installs a fresh SDK using XRB's own app ID; disconnect/reset are deterministic and modal-free.
